					<span class="share-btn-icon tie-icon-bluesky"></span> <span class="screen-reader-text">Bluesky</span>
				</a>			</div><!-- .share-links /-->
		</div><!-- .share-buttons /-->

		<div  class="featured-area"><div class="featured-area-inner"><img width="1920" height="1080" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201920%201080'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://d1fcaprh3kb5t7.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18204122/2722935b77655fb476943fa89c403282-1.jpg" class="attachment- size- wp-post-image lazy" alt="tna impact! 11/19" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" data-srcset="https://d1fcaprh3kb5t7.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18204122/2722935b77655fb476943fa89c403282-1.jpg 1920w, https://d1fcaprh3kb5t7.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18204122/2722935b77655fb476943fa89c403282-1-300x169.jpg 300w, https://d1fcaprh3kb5t7.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18204122/2722935b77655fb476943fa89c403282-1-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://d1fcaprh3kb5t7.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18204122/2722935b77655fb476943fa89c403282-1-768x432.jpg 768w, https://d1fcaprh3kb5t7.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18204122/2722935b77655fb476943fa89c403282-1-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://d1fcaprh3kb5t7.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18204122/2722935b77655fb476943fa89c403282-1-390x220.jpg 390w" data-sizes="(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px" /></div></div>		
		
		<div class="entry-content entry clearfix">

									<p>TNA Wrestling aired the latest episode of TNA iMPACT! on November 19 from WinSport Event Centre in Calgary, Alberta, Canada. The event aired on<a href="http://amc.com"> AMC</a>.</p>
<p>Full results are below.</p><div class="stream-item stream-item-in-post stream-item-inline-post aligncenter"><div class="stream-item-size" style=""><div class="article-ad">
	
</div></div></div>
<p>TNA iMPACT! Results (11/19)</p>
<ul>
<li>KC Navarro def. Bear Bronson. Cedric Alexander accidentally tripped Bear, leading to Navarro picking up the victory.</li>
<li>Nic Nemeth says he&#8217;s confident going into his title match.</li>
<li>Bear Bronson is upset with Cedric Alexander for costing him the match against Navarro. Eddie Edwards told him to let it go. Bear and Brian Myers stormed off.</li>
<li>Trey Miguel addresses his loss to Leon Slater, saying he wouldn&#8217;t make excuses and he fell short, but thinks it&#8217;s one of the greatest title matches in TNA history. Trey wanted a rematch. Nic Nemeth interrupted, saying he would be champion, so Leon wouldn&#8217;t be able to give him a rematch. Nic and Ryan Nemeth attack Trey. Leon makes the save.</li>
<li>Heather and M By Elegance discuss the cover reveal, though Heather was still upset that M didn&#8217;t help her win Ultimate X.</li>
<li>Daria Rae says Shayna Baszler should be Knockouts Champion since Indi Hartwell didn&#8217;t show up.</li>
<li>Allie is shown backstage clutching her knee. She is out of the next match, but tells her teammates to still compete.</li>
<li>Apex (Shayna Baszler &amp; Zoey Serrano) &amp; Fire ‘N Flava (Kiera Hogan &amp; Tasha Steelz) def. Gabby Forza, Indi Hartwell &amp; Shotzi Blackheart</li>
<li>Elijah speaks with Leon. The Nemeths attack.</li>
<li>Taryn Terrrell explains that she picked Mila Moore and Harley Hudson for the Dollhouse because they had become lost and needed a leader.</li>
<li>Mustafa Ali says no one in TNA has any soul.</li>
<li>Heather By Elegance tells Elayna Black that everything will work out.</li>
<li>Xia Brookside def. Sofia Sivan</li>
<li>Xia places a piece of wood between Sofia&#8217;s foot and smashes a chair on his ankle.</li>
<li>Fabian Aichner tells Jason Hotch he has an upcoming title shot. AJ Francis says he wants the winner. Ricky Sosa believes he deserves the next shot.</li>
<li>Santino announces the Triple Threat Revolver in two weeks. Matt Hardy and Moose will be part of it.</li>
<li>TNA World Championship: Leon Slater (c) def. Nic Nemeth to retain the title</li>
</ul>
<p>You can find results from around the wrestling world at <a href="https://www.fightful.com/wrestling/results">Fightful&#8217;s results section</a>.</p>

			<div class="stream-item stream-item-below-post-content"><div class="stream-item-size" style=""><div class="article-ad">
	
